Upstream treats anthropic/claude-opus-4-8 and anthropic/claude-opus-4-8(max) as
different models, so every outgoing chat message resets the fallback state and
the chain never advances past the first fallback. Compare provider/model while
ignoring the variant, and do not treat a replay of the original model as a
manual override while a fallback is pending or already active.

Must apply before chat-message-handler-internal-agents.patch, which calls
isSameModel.

